The files in this folder are copied from W3C documents:

- css-counter-styles-3.css: CSS Counter Styles Level 3, W3C Candidate
  Recommendation, 27 July 2021,
  https://www.w3.org/TR/2021/CR-css-counter-styles-3-20210727/
  Copyright © 2021 World Wide Web Consortium.
- predefined-counter-styles.css: Ready-made Counter Styles, W3C Group Note,
  7 March 2025,
  https://www.w3.org/TR/2025/NOTE-predefined-counter-styles-20250307/
  Copyright © 2014-2025 World Wide Web Consortium.

This software includes material copied from or derived from these
documents: their @counter-style rules, and the longhand Chinese and the
Ethiopic numbering algorithms of CSS Counter Styles Level 3, section 7,
implemented in plain_unicode's lib/src/counter_styles.dart.
https://www.w3.org/copyright/software-license-2023/

